# oracle: pair_style meam, two-element CsCl (lattce(1,2) = b2) alloy (w37meam_lib.meam + w37meam_b2.meam, zbl 0, nn2 = 0), non-periodic clusters: A-B dimers at 2.6 A, at 2.2 A (B-A order) and at 2.4 A, and a B-A-B chain with bonds 3.0 and 3.3 A
# oracle: the B2 pair term phi_AB = (2/8)(erose_AB - (F_A + F_B)/2) with the eight unlike neighbours of the CsCl reference (see meam_alloy.ts); the cluster energies are native values (black box)
# oracle-inputs: w37meam_lib.meam w37meam_b2.meam
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-6 abs=1e-9
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        f f f
region          box block -40 40 -40 40 -40 40
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 single 0 0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 2.6 0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 20 0 0 units box
create_atoms    1 single 22.2 0 0 units box
create_atoms    1 single 0 20 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 0 22.4 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 36 0 0 units box
create_atoms    1 single 36 3.0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 36 6.3 0 units box
mass            1 63.546
mass            2 58.69
velocity        all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 units box
pair_style      meam
pair_coeff      * * w37meam_lib.meam A B w37meam_b2.meam A B
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve
thermo          10
thermo_style    custom step pe press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
